    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>PLAY THE FREE DEMO AND WISHLIST NOW !</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/ed6782235daedeeacc252849415fb44b.avif?t=1755369109\" width=800 height=232 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can easily play for hours and have a lot of fun with this new game !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the new and amazing adventure in the depths of the jungle,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where you can train your memory ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Complete more than 240 levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Each time the levels are randomly generated !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collect unique cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- and much more in this epic adventure !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can complete the levels in a <strong>timely manner</strong>, but YOU choose how fast to play. Will you <strong>challenge</strong> yourself and beat your previous <strong>record ...</strong>\u00a0or simply <strong>have fun</strong> and <strong>relax\u00a0</strong>- it's <strong>up to you</strong> !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amaze yourself with your skills you never knew existed !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/ab5232d27dfd8b27f3938fab5a374338.avif?t=1755369109\" width=800 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/35a294630ac4eefc7fc4b6d4add0917d.poster.avif?t=1755369109\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/35a294630ac4eefc7fc4b6d4add0917d.webp?t=1755369109\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/b8627af8e2466547c46f4f1965994c77.avif?t=1755369109\" width=800 height=204 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>~ LEGENDS SAY ~</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legends</strong> say ... in ancient times the spies trained their <strong>memory</strong> by watching a box with objects, then the box closes. Little by little they were able to point the position and the direction of enormous amount of objects !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After their <strong>special training</strong> they -\u00a0<strong>legends</strong> say - were capable to <strong>memorize</strong> whole page of important document after only seeing it for a few seconds !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/b679c8b0fa8c64d64b80730a8d330007.avif?t=1755369109\" width=800 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While <strong>playing at your own pace</strong>, dive into an amazing world of <strong>fantasy</strong> and <strong>adventure</strong> with this\u00a0<strong>game</strong> ! Test your <strong>memory</strong> and <strong>concentration</strong> as you explore a <strong>jungle</strong> full of <strong>cute</strong> and <strong>funny animals</strong> ... and a lot of <strong>secrets</strong> !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>casual</strong> and <strong>fun</strong> <strong>challenge</strong>, you'll need to find <strong>matching cards</strong> and connect the <strong>pairs</strong>. With its <strong>randomly generated levels</strong> and <strong>engaging gameplay</strong>, this <strong>game</strong> is the perfect way to unwind and sharpen your <strong>skills</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of <strong>light-hearted fun</strong> or a <strong>thrilling</strong> mental <strong>test</strong>, this game can give you <strong>hours</strong> of <strong>amazing entertainment</strong>. Try it now and <strong>experience</strong> an awesome <strong>card-matching</strong> <strong>adventure</strong> in the wild !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/040208cc569b1586acab4d4e7bf2e4fa.avif?t=1755369109\" width=800 height=204 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>~ HOW TO PLAY ~</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pair the cards to remove them from the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remove all cards to finish the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are fast enought, you will mark a new highscore. Improve while having fun !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/b33207122a5aa762d1c04ea1f0770f90.avif?t=1755369109\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the easiest difficulty - Easy difficulty - the cards must be paired only by their images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the levels on all difficulties : easy, medium, hard, ultra hard !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then comes the ultimate challenge - the Almost impossible difficulty !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COME AND SHOW YOUR SKILLS !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/ceded397efa1b8a32d317c04cf4ba2d4.avif?t=1755369109\" width=800 height=204 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
