xperience</strong> an awesome <strong>card-matching</strong> <strong>adventure</strong> in the wild !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/040208cc569b1586acab4d4e7bf2e4fa.avif?t=1755369109\" width=800 height=204 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>~ HOW TO PLAY ~</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pair the cards to remove them from the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remove all cards to finish the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are fast enought, you will mark a new highscore. Improve while having fun !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/b33207122a5aa762d1c04ea1f0770f90.avif?t=1755369109\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the easiest difficulty - Easy difficulty - the cards must be paired only by their images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the levels on all difficulties : easy, medium, hard, ultra hard !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then comes the ultimate challenge - the Almost impossible difficulty !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COME AND SHOW YOUR SKILLS !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954380/extras/ceded397efa1b8a32d317c04cf4ba2d4.avif?t=1755369109\" width=800 height=204 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "I like to play the game, when I have a short break or a relaxing evening. It's best for me with a cup of cacao or coffee.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Bulgarian<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Danish<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<strong>*</strong>, Greek<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cRelaxing jungle themed memory game with cute visuals, smooth gameplay and easy achievements. A great choice for all ages and perfect for a quick mental break.\u201d<br>Twisted Winds<br><br>\u201cWhen I first started Memory Adventures in the Jungle, I expected a simple matching game with gradually more cards. An easy straightforward experience. However, it quickly became more challenging and required real effort to achieve a decent score. The progression from simple to complex was well paced and kept me angaged. The visuals are clean and clear and my kids loved the adorable animals characters ...\u201d<br>The Starving Writer<br><br>\u201cEmbark on a captivating journey into the heart of the jungle with &quot;Memory Adventures in the Jungle&quot; where classic card-matching gameplay intertwines with the thrill of exploration. This game offers over 240 randomly generated levels, ensuring each playthrough is a fresh and engaging experience. The charming animal illustrations and escalating challenges not only entertain but also serve as a delightful exercise for the mind. Whether you're aiming to beat your previous records or simply unwind, this adventure caters to both competitive spirits and casual gamers alike.\u201d<br>OverageGmngCom<br>",
